+- Verified compiled dist file contains the fix (lines 636-639 show gateIndex/gateArgs extraction)
+- Diff reviewed by four independent layers (blind-hunter, edge-case-hunter, verification-gap, intent-alignment)
+- No blocking issues found; one low-severity patch found regarding test coverage
